  "merits": "The tenth of Zilhajj is the Eid al-Azhaa (The feast of immolation) Day. A number of acts has been narrated to be done on this honorable day.\n\nGhusl: In fact, some scholars have decided it as obligatory.\n\nSupplications of Salat al-Eid: These supplications are mentioned in the book of Iqbal al-Aa’mal."
